W44-76 per-block AC tokenization bisection meta
================================================

Date:      2026-05-19
Git base:  98515203 (W44-75 upstream clustering bisection)
Sibling:   ~/work/zen/jxl-encoder--w44-76-per-block-bisect
libjxl:    ~/work/jxl-efforts/libjxl--w44-76-per-block-debug-dump
